# Working media that is not part of the deployed site.
#
# These are source folders — raw video, unedited photos, exported frames —
# kept beside the project for convenience. Nothing under them is referenced
# by any page (checked across every .html in the repo), but they made every
# deploy upload roughly 24MB, which on a slow connection is the difference
# between a deploy that finishes and one that times out.
#
# Anything the site actually serves lives in assets/ or inside a page folder,
# and is untouched by this file. If you ever reference a file from one of the
# folders below, move it into assets/ first or it will 404 in production.

calm video and photo/
lips photos and videos/
collagen glow/
ksa gluco photos/
cha3r/
lug/

# one-off frame exports left over from video work
_frame_*.png

# unused product shots sitting inside page folders
ksa-glow/offers.png
ksa-masar/ingredients.png

# local tooling, never part of a deploy
node_modules/
.env.local
